Subject: [PATCH] media: siano: fix oops in smsdvb_hotplug() due to race
 condition
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:43:32 +0900
Message-ID: <20261018054403.76055-1-ryotaro.banno@gmail.com>
